  - title: Welcome!
    body: 'Make the room yours: choose colors and surface finishes, then rearrange the furniture.'
    advanceOn: 0
  - title: Pick a color
    body: Use the palette to choose a color, or select a finish from the design toolbar.
    advanceOn: 1
  - title: Point and paint
    body: Aim at an object with your right hand and press the trigger.
    advanceOn: 2
  - title: Things react
    body: Some objects come alive when painted. Try to find them!
    advanceOn: 0
  - title: Track your progress
    body: The counter next to the palette shows how many objects you have painted.
    advanceOn: 0
  - title: Have fun!
    body: Press the left primary button to pin the palette in the world.
    advanceOn: 0
